{"path":"utility/variant/holds_alternative","title":"std::holds_alternative","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>holds_alternative","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/variant/holds_alternative","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Checks if the variant v holds the alternative T. The call is ill-formed if T does not appear exactly once in Types...","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/variant\">&lt;variant&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Types</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> holds_alternative<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant\"><span class=\"kw1093\">std::<span class=\"me2\">variant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> v <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks if the variant <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">v</span></code> holds the alternative <code>T</code>. The call is ill-formed if <code>T</code> does not appear exactly once in <code>Types...</code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> v\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> variant to examine\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the variant currently holds the alternative <code>T</code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;variant&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant\"><span class=\"kw1093\">std::<span class=\"me2\">variant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1237\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> v <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"abc\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>not std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">holds_alternative</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>v<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">holds_alternative</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1237\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>v<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/index\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>index</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the zero-based index of the alternative held by the <code>variant</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/get\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>get<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::variant)</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  reads the value of the variant given the index or the type (if the type is unique), throws on error <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/variant","title":"std::variant"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::holds_alternative","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. Checks if the variant v holds the alternative T. The call is ill-formed if T does not appear exactly once in Types..."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"v"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if the variant currently holds the alternative T, false otherwise."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"index","note":"returns the zero-based index of the alternative held by the variant"},{"label":"get(std::variant)","note":"reads the value of the variant given the index or the type (if the type is unique), throws on error"}]}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":119,"codeBlockCount":1}
